{"id":"5973","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5973_main_cumulus-congestus-praecipitatio-arcus-pannus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在这张全景图中，在一行浓积云上及其前方的阵风锋表明冷锋的到来；一些浓积云的顶部清晰可见（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>）。在远处<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>可看到降水柱（降水性附加特征）。图中前景是在阵风锋上形成的云。它是阴暗的水平滚云，边缘有些破烂。这是弧状云（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">弧状附加特征</span>），它位于伴生云的前下部。当范围大时，弧状云可显现出阴暗恐怖的弧形。</p>\n<p>在含雨浓积云下方的湿润层中形成了碎片附属云的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">稀疏且完全分离的小碎片</span>。根据这一形成过程可将碎片云确定为潮湿天气的碎积云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，切尔西区","latitude":"纬度: 38° 2' 57'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 7' 30'' E","date":"09 April 2011 1604 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 7, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.10"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5973_syn_cumulus-congestus-praecipitatio-arcus-pannus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当地时间15:00的天气图显示出1000 hPa低压，中心在澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚西南。伴生冷锋正在靠近拍摄位置（红色箭头）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2011，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5973_upper_cumulus-congestus-praecipitatio-arcus-pannus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>照片拍摄前几小时，在0000 UTC澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本机场（WMO 94866）的探测显示出有利于对流发展的不稳定大气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5973_sat_cumulus-congestus-praecipitatio-arcus-pannus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>MTSAT卫星4号通道红外图像显示，宽广的锋面云掠过在澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本滨湾郊区上空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2011，澳大利亚气象局/日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}